OL,6,
OL,7,F"Council has budget hole of millions"
OL,8,Fis not a headline which surprises
OL,9,Fanyone working or dealing with local
OL,10,Fgovernment.
OL,12,FBut the extent of the issue has been
OL,13,Frevealed in new research from the BBC
OL,14,FShared Data Unit.
OL,16,FHampshire County Council needs to find
OL,17,F#179.7m by the end of 2027/28.
